==English==

===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|prenuptial|agreement}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[legal]] [[document]], signed by both [[parties]] before [[marriage]], stating the legal [[claim]]s on each other's [[estate]] upon a [[subsequent]] [[divorce]].

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|antenuptial agreement}}
* {{l|en|premarital agreement}}
* {{l|en|prenup}}, {{l|en|prenuptial}}

